      "conditions": [
        "Vanquish, never convert: a converted Sister hands over no Hound and no component blueprint.",
        "Every vanquish drops one random Hound component blueprint, so eight parts need at least eight Sisters.",
        "The Hound a vanquished Sister mails you arrives fully built but ungilded, and still needs rank 30, gilding, then rank 30 again to earn Mastery.",
        "A second Hound sharing a Model you already gilded is worth zero Mastery, whatever its other parts.",
        "The Treasurer vanishes if you take too long, and its Zenith Granum Crown is consumed on every Granum Void entry."
      ],
      "bonuses": ["Each vanquish also hands over her Tenet weapon and her own fully built Hound."],
      "disclosures": [
        {
          "title": "the Granum Void loop",
          "body": "Spend a Zenith Granum Crown at a Golden Hand Tribute to open the Nightmare Granum Void, where you have 60 seconds to kill Errant Specters. Rank 1 needs 25 kills, plus 25 per extra squad member. Particles add 5 seconds, and freeing a captive Solaris with the Xoris adds 20. Reaching Rank 1 spawns the Candidate back on the Corpus Ship; the last hit lets you Mercy her. If you finish the Void within roughly 150-200 meters of extraction, the Candidate won't spawn."
        },
        {
          "title": "which Core, Bracket and Stabilizer to keep",
          "body": "Only the Model earns Mastery, so the other blueprints are stat and precept picks. Adlet has 450 base shields, Garmr 450 armor, Raiju 450 health. Cela adds 15% shields (30% gilded), Zubb 10%, and Urga costs 5%. Frak gives Vazarin polarity, Hinta Madurai, Wanz Naramon."
        }
      ]
